  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Wish + pasado simple (deseos sobre el presente)**",
      "",
      "| Realidad | Deseo | Ejemplo |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| *I don't live by the sea.* | *I wish I **lived** by the sea.* | Ojalá viviera junto al mar |",
      "| *I can't swim.* | *I wish I **could** swim.* | Ojalá pudiera nadar |",
      "| *It's raining.* | *I wish it **weren't** raining.* | Ojalá no lloviera |",
      "| *I have to work.* | *I wish I **didn't have to** work.* | Ojalá no tuviera que trabajar |",
      "",
      "**Reglas**",
      "",
      "- Después de *wish* el verbo va en **pasado**, pero se refiere al **presente**.",
      "- Con *be*: *I wish I **were** …* (más formal) o *was* (coloquial).",
      "- *Can* → *could*; *will* → *would* (para cosas que molestan de otros): *I wish he **would** stop smoking.*",
      "- *If only* es más enfático: *If only I **had** more time!*",
      "",
      "**Wish + would** (quejas sobre algo que otros hacen o no hacen): *I wish you **would** listen.* / *I wish it **would** stop raining.*",
      "",
      "**Wish vs hope**",
      "",
      "- *I **wish** I were rich.* (es irreal) · *I **hope** I'll be rich.* (es posible)",
      "",
      "**Errores típicos:** ✘ *I wish I have more time* → ✔ *I wish I **had** more time*. ✘ *I wish I would be rich* → ✔ *I wish I **were** rich*.",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *wish* /wɪʃ/ · *brave* /breɪv/ · *complain* /kəmˈpleɪn/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I wish I have more time.",
        "right": "I wish I had more time.",
        "note": "Wish + pasado."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I wish I would be rich.",
        "right": "I wish I were rich.",
        "note": "No would be."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
